{"signature": "6506d5634e0806d3e933197bd453d6b8d3fe96558cab0523e52d8357d52bd32d", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "confluence", "file": "confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments", "field": "page_id", "values": ["page_economy_design", "page_live_ops_engine", "page_zm3d_gdd"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments/2", "field": "page_id", "value": "page_economy_design", "record": {"id": "comment_economy_design_c1", "page_id": "page_economy_design", "author_id": "user_EMPLOYEE_0016", "parent_id": null, "body": "The pre-cut 99th-percentile earn of ~25k/day was wild - players were sitting on months of boosters. Good call locking the warning macro on this page so nobody quietly bumps rewards back up on GoD.", "created_at": "2025-04-22T15:40:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-22T15:40:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments/3", "field": "page_id", "value": "page_economy_design", "record": {"id": "comment_economy_design_c2", "page_id": "page_economy_design", "author_id": "user_EMPLOYEE_0005", "parent_id": "comment_economy_design_c1", "body": "Agreed. Post-cut the ~8.5k/day ceiling holds and booster spend is up like we modeled. I'll keep dynamite / rewind / wildcard as the cheap utility sinks and revisit only if conversion dips.", "created_at": "2025-04-23T09:12:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-23T09:12:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments/4", "field": "page_id", "value": "page_live_ops_engine", "record": {"id": "comment_live_ops_engine_c1", "page_id": "page_live_ops_engine", "author_id": "user_EMPLOYEE_0025", "parent_id": null, "body": "The single-scheduler design has bothered me since we shipped it. Twelve-plus hours with no alert is the real failure here - the stall itself is recoverable, but nobody knew until revenue told us. Watchdog + heartbeat should jump ahead of leader election on the list; it's a fraction of the effort and covers the worst case.", "created_at": "2025-07-28T09:12:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-28T09:12:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments/5", "field": "page_id", "value": "page_live_ops_engine", "record": {"id": "comment_live_ops_engine_c2", "page_id": "page_live_ops_engine", "author_id": "user_EMPLOYEE_0031", "parent_id": "comment_live_ops_engine_c1", "body": "Agreed, Arthur Blake. I've reordered remediation so the heartbeat + external watchdog is first. Decoupling lives from event firing is the bigger refactor but it's what actually stops one stall from becoming two outages - I'll scope that after the watchdog lands.", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:47:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-28T15:47:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments/10", "field": "page_id", "value": "page_zm3d_gdd", "record": {"id": "comment_zm3d_gdd_c1", "page_id": "page_zm3d_gdd", "author_id": "user_EMPLOYEE_0005", "parent_id": null, "body": "Robert - I pulled the 7-slot tray down to 6 in a soft-test branch and D1 retention held while frustration churn dropped. The pile physics already gives us enough dig pressure. Worth a proper A/B before we lock it into the GDD?", "created_at": "2025-07-22T10:14:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-22T10:14:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "pointer": "/comments/11", "field": "page_id", "value": "page_zm3d_gdd", "record": {"id": "comment_zm3d_gdd_c2", "page_id": "page_zm3d_gdd", "author_id": "user_EMPLOYEE_0016", "parent_id": "comment_zm3d_gdd_c1", "body": "Julia Lawson - agreed on the A/B, but let's not touch tray count during the Season Pass window. It swings the difficulty curve too hard and skews pass-progression pacing right when we're reading purchase intent. Let's queue the 6-slot test for after the season ends and keep the GDD at 7 for now.", "created_at": "2025-07-22T15:47:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-22T15:47:00Z"}}], "records_checked": 12, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/confluence/confluence_working.json", "manifest_sha256": "e6840608051cf49e37aeb94a719fed78e0d38eb902d30f86805b84ea0d67adb6", "freshness": "970c4a92af37d08dd66b69b75daa8db99f043a7078d21e855c130a5f6081383c"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "77062151785f4b9787525130bb20c15848d15ccfe6ee88d83b8641432af8ef37"}